text = "You recently moved to a samll town for your new jobb, as a grave guard.

But the small litle town has a mysteries aura surounding it, you felt it the first day you entered but you couldnt really put your finger on what it was. There is also stories about ghost and zombies being seen in the night around the gravecyard and how the last few grave guards have gone missing without a trace during the night. 

